        "diet": "Omnivore",
        "temperament": "Calculating",
        "wild": "Parabuteo veðrfölnir is an unusually intelligent bird of prey found on Fjordur. It is calculating in its behavior, observing its surroundings carefully before acting. It feeds on the carcasses of fallen creatures and has developed a curious relationship with survivors — it will approach those who have recently made kills, apparently hoping to share the spoils.",
        "domesticated": "The Fjordhawk is a shoulder pet with an extraordinary ability: when its bonded owner is killed, it will collect their inventory and return it to them upon respawn. This item retrieval capability makes it one of the most valuable companions in dangerous environments. It is passively tamed by allowing it to feed on freshly killed creature corpses."
